  then sees region:KitOpenNotes
  contract newest written at the top, in Needs your answer and the open notes alike
  contract ten are shown and a button shows more, saying how many are hidden, as a board column does (BEH-BOARD-7)
  contract the API still sends every open note; paging the request waits until a notes file is long enough to be slow

behaviour BEH-NOTE-10 "A note the spec already cites is shown as folded, ready to dismiss"
