  actor engineer
  when opens page:KitProject
  then sees region:KitOpenNotes
  contract a behaviour folds a note by naming it in its source line: `source defined <app>.notes.md#<yyyy-mm-dd>-<hhmm>`
  contract a cited note leaves the open notes for a Folded list that links every behaviour citing it, so open means nobody has folded it yet
  contract dismissing a folded note is still his tap: the fold is a pull request into dev, and the notes file lives on the branch Kit writes, so the fold cannot delete it (BEH-NOTE-3)

behaviour BEH-KIND-1 "Every card shows its layer, ui, ux or technical, and the board filters by it"
