  contract my assumption: "asks him something" means the request's note ends in a question mark; the card carries a question badge, and only a rung card sits above it

behaviour BEH-LOOK-1 "Kit looks like a professional tool: one spacing scale, quiet greys, one accent"
  in FEAT-NAV
  in FEAT-BOARD
  in FEAT-PROJECT
