  contract my assumption: colour is kept for meaning, so the nav and every heading that links read in the text colour; the accent stays on the brand, the selected tab and links in running prose
  contract not mine: the cards' large radius and the teal filter chip come from the design-system package, and changing those is his (BEH-LOOK-1)

